%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% requires: resident-outlines
% Scenario: Helvetica stays unembedded. Helvetica text beside Palatino
% text on the same page: the Palatino font dictionary embeds its
% subset program, the Helvetica one names the standard font and has no
% font file.
% Expect: one page.
/Palatino-Roman findfont 12 scalefont setfont
100 700 moveto (Pa) show
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
100 680 moveto (Hi) show
showpage
